flowchart TD
    Home([Home])

    Home --> Seasons[Seasons List]
    Seasons --> SeasonDetail[Season Detail]
    SeasonDetail --> TeamDetail[Team Detail]

    TeamDetail --> RosterMgmt[Roster Management\nAdd / Edit / Remove Players]
    TeamDetail --> PositionConfig[Position Configuration\nField View + List View]
    TeamDetail --> ProfileConfig[Playing Time Profiles\nEqual Time / Custom]
    TeamDetail --> GamesList[Games List]

    GamesList --> GameSetup[Game Setup\nOpponent · Periods · Length · Profile · Roster Availability]
    GameSetup --> PreGame[Pre-Game Lineup\nDrag players onto field positions]

    PreGame --> ClockBar

    subgraph GameDayView[Game Day View]
        ClockBar[Clock Bar\nStart · Pause · Period · Stoppage]
        FieldView[Field View\nLive positions + time-on-field indicators]
        SubQueue[Sub Queue\nOrdered queue of pending subs]
        PlayerBar[Player Bar\nBench players + minutes played]
    end

    ClockBar --> SubWorkflow[Sub Workflow\nSelect Out → Select In → Assign Position → Confirm]
    SubWorkflow --> FieldView

    FieldView --> EventLog[Event Log\nEditable timeline of all subs/events]
    EventLog --> FieldView

    ClockBar --> GameSummary[Game Summary\nPer-player minutes · Positions · Sub history]
    GameSummary --> GamesList
